>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHATEST.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 MSG PIC X(440).
01 MSG-LEN PIC 9(4).
01 HEX PIC X(64).
01 EXPECTED PIC X(64).
01 FAILURES PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE SPACES TO MSG
    MOVE 0 TO MSG-LEN
    MOVE "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"
        TO EXPECTED
    PERFORM CHECK-ONE

    MOVE SPACES TO MSG
    MOVE "abc" TO MSG
    MOVE 3 TO MSG-LEN
    MOVE "ba7816bf8f01cfea414140de5dae2223b00361a396177a9cb410ff61f20015ad"
        TO EXPECTED
    PERFORM CHECK-ONE

    MOVE SPACES TO MSG
    MOVE "abcdbcdecdefdefgefghfghighijhijkijkljklmklmnlmnomnopnopq"
        TO MSG
    MOVE 56 TO MSG-LEN
    MOVE "248d6a61d20638b8e5c026930c3e6039a33ce45964ff2167f6ecedd419db06c1"
        TO EXPECTED
    PERFORM CHECK-ONE

    MOVE ALL "A" TO MSG
    MOVE 224 TO MSG-LEN
    MOVE "7858f023caa797437e00fb414e9298596b9ed7d7a864ab6190f3a792c310f199"
        TO EXPECTED
    PERFORM CHECK-ONE

    IF FAILURES = 0
        DISPLAY "SHA-256 OK"
        MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "SHA-256 NG " FAILURES
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
    END-IF
    STOP RUN
    .

CHECK-ONE.
    CALL "SHA256" USING MSG MSG-LEN HEX
    IF HEX = EXPECTED
        DISPLAY "OK " HEX
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "NG got " HEX
        DISPLAY "   exp " EXPECTED
        ADD 1 TO FAILURES
    END-IF
    .

END PROGRAM SHATEST.
